Backport of the upstream nlohmann/json fix for `auto* const` iterators under libc++:
issue https://github.com/nlohmann/json/issues/3081, fixed by pull request
https://github.com/nlohmann/json/pull/3082 ("Revert invalid fix"), released in
nlohmann/json v3.10.4 (MIT). jinjar 0.3.2 bundles inja, which carries an older json.hpp.
`patch` ignores this text before the first diff header.

--- a/src/inja/nlohmann/json.hpp
+++ b/src/inja/nlohmann/json.hpp
@@ -17098,7 +17098,7 @@
